hadiths[count]{hadithnumber,text}:
"2855","###\n Narrated to us Muhammad bin Yahya, who said: Narrated to us Abdullah bin Muhammad an-Nufayli, who said: Narrated to us Hatim bin Ismail, from Ja'far bin Muhammad, from his father, from Jabir (RA), who mentioned the hadith and said: \"He (the Prophet ﷺ) prayed Fajr when the dawn became clear to him, meaning at Muzdalifah.\" Abu Bakr (the narrator of this commentary) said: Muhammad bin Yahya said to us: Al-Hasan"
